#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:86
msgid "Search"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:88
msgid "It is not required any more to wait until a search is finished to open the context menu on search results."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:92
msgid "A couple of new toolbar buttons were added:"
