#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour420.md:94
msgid "View Switcher - A drop-down button to select a view."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour420.md:95
msgid "Menu - This hamburger button will show automatically in the toolbar, when the menubar is hidden. It will reveal a vertical menu, bar, when pressed."
